{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "柴田柚菜です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41枚目シングルアンダーライブ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このシングルのこのメンバーでアンダーライブが出来て、その一員でいられたこと、この経験ができたこと本当に良かった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そう思えるライブ期間でした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回から6期生が参加してくれました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "仲が深まり、みんなが全力で頑張って悩んで成長していく時に近くに居られて本当に良かったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハは物凄く大変な期間だったと思うけど、本番で可愛くかっこよくキラキラしてるみんなを見ることができてうれしかった。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "数年後、「これを経験できて良かった」って思える時がきっと来ると思うなあ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最終日の朝ひーつんが卒業式終わり制服で来てて、みんなに囲まれてる姿が尊かった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業おめでとう☺︎🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobICqBU0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして6期生と先輩のペアで披露したユニットコーナーでは、みつきとペアでした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ボイトレのときから2人の声合うね~と言ってもらえました☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりに\"雲になればいい\"を歌えたのも嬉しかった~！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がこの曲を初めて披露したのは9th YEAR BIRTHDAY LIVEでした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私を応援してくださっているみなさんが、「それきっかけで好きになった、応援しはじめた」とよく言ってくれます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みつきの歌も素敵な人柄も、たくさんの方により伝わる機会になっていたらいいなあ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてこのライブ期間で仲良くなれて嬉しかったよ~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもっとたくさんお話ししようね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつでも頭ぽんぽんする( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobjLCctG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また、自分としては"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "成長している自分がいてびっくりしました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たしかに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "加入して7年経つけど「まだ出来る、もっと良くなる」と感じます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも向上心があっていいですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本番を迎えてからも今できることをやってもっとよくしようと努力しました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "成長に限界はないみたい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも頑張り続けてみる☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobzjQrPe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りかの卒業セレモニーもありました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "水色がとっても似合ってて素敵だった~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きなんだけど伝わってるのかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいっっってなる瞬間がよくある"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またカラオケいきたいね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "残りの時間いっぱい喋ろ( ¨̮ )🩵"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobWQGkGm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブの前の前の日ぐらいにずっと喋ってて気付いたら朝方だった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きなれんかさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れんかさんが近くに居てくださるから成長できています☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "\"愛って羨ましい\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポジションもお隣でした！！わーい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かっこよくて優しい3人の先輩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "強くて頼もしい3人の同期"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張り屋さんで可愛い後輩たち"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても大切な期間になりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41stシングルは4月8日発売です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "表題曲「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオも公開されました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今シングルも最後までよろしくお願いします✊🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobbv6gxu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツーショット"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回の会場、ぴあアリーナMMはちょうど一年前に座長をつとめたアンダーライブの会場でもありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この一年間で物凄く変わりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "変わったというのは良い方にです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気持ちもパフォーマンスも。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "比べると、たった一年前なのに全然違うように感じます。見るのも恥ずかしいぐらい…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして\"交感神経優位\"は一年でこんなにもみなさんに愛される楽曲になりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブで色々な演出をさせていただいたり、最近たくさん披露させていただけて幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "歌い出したとき、みなさんの声がよく聞こえていつもびっくりします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございます！☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVもたくさん観ていただき嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！🦋"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもたくさん愛される曲でありますように！！届けてく！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読んでくれてありがとう！またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（3.22 柴田柚菜）"}], "source": "official"}